                            <comment id="354878" author="JIRAUSER17900" created="Fri, 2 Dec 2022 02:21:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;In patch (&lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/#/c/fs/lustre-release/+/49178/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/#/c/fs/lustre-release/+/49178/&lt;/a&gt;), Dongyang ported the master patch of &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-15706&quot; title=&quot;&amp;quot;lctl pool_destroy&amp;quot; can&apos;t work correctly due to &amp;quot;SKIP&amp;quot; records in llog&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-15706&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-15706&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to b2_15 to solve this issue.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="502872" author="adilger" created="Mon, 5 Oct 2026 21:08:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Claude&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Interop failures (master servers with b2_15/b2_16 clients, full-part-3) from the compound permanent parameter change f69f27cc35 (&quot;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17920&quot; title=&quot;Add permanent TBF rules&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-17920&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-17920&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; mgs: handle compound permanent parameters&quot;). Last failure 2026-08-20 (lustre-master build 4749); stopped after &lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/67653&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/67653&lt;/a&gt; &quot;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17920&quot; title=&quot;Add permanent TBF rules&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-17920&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-17920&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; tests: skip interop conf-sanity/123ag+123ae&quot; (commit 4384a68e6883) landed 2026-08-22.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
